@startuml
title VERI*FACTU — emisión, cadena, remisión y QR
autonumber
actor Cajero
participant POS
participant "Orders API" as API
participant "Fiscal Core" as FIS
database "PostgreSQL\nappend-only" as DB
queue "Outbox / cola durable" as Q
participant "Fiscal worker" as W
participant AEAT
participant "Document renderer" as DOC
Cajero -> POS : confirmar venta
POS -> API : POST /invoices\nIdempotency-Key
API -> FIS : congelar snapshot + reservar serie/número
FIS -> FIS : construir RF alta\nSHA-256 + previous_hash
FIS -> DB : commit Invoice + RF + outbox
DB --> API : invoice_id, estado pending
API --> POS : documento pendiente de remisión
Q -> W : fiscal.record.created
W -> AEAT : remitir RF (XML/JSON oficial)
AEAT --> W : acuse / error
W -> DB : estado y evidencia de envío
API -> DOC : render factura + QR tributario
DOC --> POS : PDF/ESC-POS con QR y leyenda
note right of FIS
Nunca UPDATE/DELETE de RF.
Anulación = nuevo RF vinculado.
end note
@enduml
